ReadingModePages.tsx the head's form kept (the goal's line let down by
movePage, the goalBox) with the patch's one row, its clicks and the page
that is on brought into sight. His call of 14:29 added: the Reading mode
page's shelves and the Bible's own sheet click as the Settings row does
(modeRow.test.ts, failing on the old code). The keys no screen reads any
more leave English; the 20 other catalogs follow in the languages commit.

